{"seq":2,"slug":"logic-and-computability-foundations","title":"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/logic-and-computability-foundations","wordCount":2902,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基\">数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基</h1><p>1936 年同时出现两份否定性证明：丘奇用 λ 演算、图灵用图灵机，各自独立否定了希尔伯特 1928 年提出的判定问题（Entscheidungsproblem）。它们把「计算」从一个模糊直觉，第一次逼成可被数学精确刻画的对象。今天写编译器、设计查询引擎、判断静态分析能否精确 —— 背后站着的都是这套 1930 年代奠基的语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解这段历史，关键是看到一个纲领如何被自己的严谨性推翻。希尔伯特纲领要求把全部数学形式化，并证明该形式系统<strong>完备</strong>、<strong>一致</strong>、<strong>可判定</strong>。哥德尔 1931 年先拆掉前两根支柱，丘奇与图灵 1936 年拆掉第三根；此后「可计算」不再依赖具体机器，而被抽象为一个等价类。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    H[Hilbert 纲领 1920s&lt;br/&gt;完备 / 一致 / 可判定] --&gt; A[Hilbert-Ackermann 1928&lt;br/&gt;提出判定问题]&#10;    A --&gt; G[Gödel 1931&lt;br/&gt;不完备性定理]&#10;    G --&gt; C[Church 1936&lt;br/&gt;λ 演算 + 丘奇定理]&#10;    G --&gt; T[Turing 1936&lt;br/&gt;图灵机 + 停机问题]&#10;    C --&gt; CT[Church-Turing 论题&lt;br/&gt;有效可计算 = 图灵可计算]&#10;    T --&gt; CT&#10;    CT --&gt; M[现代计算理论&lt;br/&gt;可计算性 / 复杂度 / SMT]\">graph TD\n    H[Hilbert 纲领 1920s&lt;br/&gt;完备 / 一致 / 可判定] --&gt; A[Hilbert-Ackermann 1928&lt;br/&gt;提出判定问题]\n    A --&gt; G[Gödel 1931&lt;br/&gt;不完备性定理]\n    G --&gt; C[Church 1936&lt;br/&gt;λ 演算 + 丘奇定理]\n    G --&gt; T[Turing 1936&lt;br/&gt;图灵机 + 停机问题]\n    C --&gt; CT[Church-Turing 论题&lt;br/&gt;有效可计算 = 图灵可计算]\n    T --&gt; CT\n    CT --&gt; M[现代计算理论&lt;br/&gt;可计算性 / 复杂度 / SMT]</pre><p>三个 1936 年前后的形式化，用完全不同的语汇描述了同一个计算类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式化</th>\n<th>提出者</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>核心对象 / 关键结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般递归函数</td>\n<td>Gödel / Herbrand，Kleene 完善</td>\n<td>1933–1936</td>\n<td>递归定义的函数类；与 λ 可定义等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>λ 演算</td>\n<td>Church（与 Kleene）</td>\n<td>1932–1936</td>\n<td>λ 项及 β-归约；表达式等价性不可判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图灵机（a-machine）</td>\n<td>Turing</td>\n<td>1936</td>\n<td>纸带 + 有限状态表；停机问题不可判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>三者的等价性不是巧合，而是「有效可计算」这一直觉概念在不同坐标系下的同一投影。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"希尔伯特纲领与判定问题\">希尔伯特纲领与判定问题</h2><p>希尔伯特 1920 年代提出的纲领有五个目标：形式化、完备性、一致性、保守性（conservation）与可判定性，前三者常被概括为「三问」。1928 年他与阿克曼（Wilhelm Ackermann）合著的《理论逻辑纲要》（<em>Grundzüge der theoretischen Logik</em>）把第三问写成精确形式：<strong>是否存在一个算法，对任意一阶逻辑公式，判定它是否在所有结构中都有效？</strong> 这就是判定问题（Entscheidungsproblem）。</p>\n<p>判定问题的诱人之处在于，它把一个看似哲学的问题压缩成工程问题：给我一个通用过程，喂进公式，输出「有效」或「无效」。在希尔伯特看来，这不过是一个尚未解决的数学难题。迟至 1930 年，他仍在柯尼斯堡的演讲中宣称「我们必须知道，我们必将知道」（Wir müssen wissen, wir werden wissen）—— 这番话录于哥德尔公布不完备性结果的前一天。</p>\n<p>逻辑史一个常被忽略的事实是：<strong>一阶逻辑的有效性判定确实存在局部解</strong>。勒文海姆（Löwenheim）在 1915 年已证明一元谓词逻辑（monadic predicate logic）可判定；1929 年哥德尔又给出完备性定理，把「有效」与「可证」在可数情形下等同起来，于是判定可证性与判定有效性是同一个问题。局部可判定性让希尔伯特有理由乐观，但整体上的答案是否定的（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hilbert%27s_program\">Hilbert&#39;s program</a>、<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entscheidungsproblem\">Entscheidungsproblem</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哥德尔不完备性定理\">哥德尔不完备性定理</h2><p>1930 年 8 月哥德尔（Kurt Gödel）先向卡尔纳普、费格尔与魏斯曼透露了第一个结果，随后在柯尼斯堡的「精确科学认识论第二届会议」上公开，1931 年正式发表《论《数学原理》及其相关系统形式不可判定命题 I》。</p>\n<p>对任意<strong>一致</strong>、<strong>有效公理化</strong>且能表达初等算术的形式系统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 中存在既不能证明也不能否证的语句（第一不完备性定理）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 的一致性无法在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 自身内部得到证明（第二不完备性定理）。</p>\n<p>证明的核心装置是<strong>哥德尔配数</strong>（Gödel numbering）：把每个公式和证明唯一编码成自然数，于是「某串符号是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的证明」这一元数学陈述，变成算术关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⌜</mi></mo><mi>φ</mi><mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⌝</mi></mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Prf}_F(p, \\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">Prf</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen amsrm\">┌</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mclose amsrm\">┐</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。再借对角化（diagonalization）构造自指句：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>↔</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⌜</mi></mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⌝</mi></mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_F \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists p\\, \\mathrm{Prf}_F(p, \\ulcorner G_F \\urcorner)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">Prf</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen amsrm\">┌</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose amsrm\">┐</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「我不可证」。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 一致，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不可证；在哥德尔原始证明所要求的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span>-一致性假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg G_F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也不可证；1936 年罗塞尔（J. B. Rosser）把假设弱化为普通一致性。</p>\n<p>这击穿了希尔伯特纲领的完备性与一致性两根支柱，也为判定问题埋下伏笔：<strong>若存在通用判定过程，就能对所有公式判定可证性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的可证性也可机械判定</strong> —— 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的构造矛盾。哥德尔配数 + 对角化这套模板，随即被丘奇和图灵各自移植到自己的计算模型上（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/G%C3%B6del%27s_incompleteness_theorems\">Gödel&#39;s incompleteness theorems</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"丘奇的-演算与丘奇定理\">丘奇的 λ 演算与丘奇定理</h2><p>丘奇与克莱尼（Stephen Kleene）从 1932–1933 年开始构造 λ 演算，作为研究数学基础的函数记号系统。1935 年克莱尼与罗塞尔发现丘奇最初那套系统不一致（Kleene–Rosser 悖论）。1936 年丘奇把其中与计算相关的子系统单独提取出来 —— 这就是今天的无类型 λ 演算，发表在《初等数论的一个不可解问题》（<em>An Unsolvable Problem of Elementary Number Theory</em>）中。</p>\n<p>λ 演算只有三条语法规则：变量、抽象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda x.\\, M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、应用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M\\,N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，计算靠 β-归约：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>N</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\lambda x.\\, M)\\,N \\;\\to_\\beta\\; M[x := N]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它把「函数」和「对函数求值」当作仅有的两个原语；一个函数是<strong>λ 可定义</strong>的，当且仅当存在一个 λ 项在 β-等价下与之对应（如丘奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_n = \\lambda f.\\lambda x.\\, f^{\\,n}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>丘奇的结论（丘奇定理）是：<strong>不存在算法能判定两个 λ 表达式是否等价</strong>。证明思路与哥德尔同构 —— 用哥德尔配数编码 λ 项，再构造自指项，把问题归约到「该项是否有范式」。这是历史上第一个被严格证明不可判定的问题，比图灵的结果略早，因此 1936 年图灵读完丘奇的工作后，才在论文附录补上自己模型的等价性论证。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>值得留意：λ 演算不是为机器写的，却在半个世纪后成了函数式语言（Lisp、Haskell、OCaml）与类型论（Coq、Lean 内核）的血脉；丘奇关心的判定问题，今天以「类型检查是否可判定」重回每个编译器（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lambda_calculus\">Lambda calculus</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"图灵机与通用图灵机\">图灵机与通用图灵机</h2><p>图灵 1936 年的论文《论可计算数及其在判定问题上的应用》1937 年发表于《伦敦数学学会会刊》第二辑 42 卷 230–265 页（1938 年另发勘误于 43 卷 544–546 页，修订伯奈斯指出的错误）。图灵没有借用 λ 演算，而是从「一个人按固定规则在纸上计算」这个动作出发，抽象出一台机器：一条无限纸带、一个读写头、一张有限状态表。</p>\n<p>对被判定为「成功」的机器，图灵称之为<strong>无环的</strong>（circle-free）—— 它会无限地打印二进制数字；反之称为有环的（circular）。这个区分正是停机问题的雏形。论文的第二项贡献是<strong>通用机器</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>：给定任意机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的标准描述，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 能「计算与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 相同的序列」。这就是「一台机器模拟另一台机器」的可执行定义 —— 存储程序计算机的理论先声。</p>\n<p>图灵把判定问题归约到他的机器上：<strong>若判定问题可解，则可判定任意机器是否无环</strong>，而后者不可能。用今天的语言，这等价于停机问题，其判定集为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>∣</mo><mtext>程序 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext> 在输入 </mtext><mi>x</mi><mtext> 上停机</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = \\{\\langle i, x\\rangle \\mid \\text{程序 } i \\text{ 在输入 } x \\text{ 上停机}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">程序</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在输入</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上停机</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是递归可枚举的，其补集不是。停机集合的不可判定性可用对角化简洁证出：假设存在全可计算判定器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，构造程序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(e,e)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时停机、否则死循环，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(e,e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 与真实行为必然矛盾。这条论证与康托尔对角线法同源，后被赖斯定理（Rice&#39;s theorem）推广为「程序的任何非平凡语义性质都不可判定」。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>「停机问题」（halting problem）这个术语并非图灵本人所造 —— 他论文里讨论的是可满足性、可打印性与判定问题。该名称通常归于马丁·戴维斯（Martin Davis）1952 年的讲座，并于 1958 年的《可计算性与不可解性》一书定型（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_Computable_Numbers,_with_an_Application_to_the_Entscheidungsproblem\">On Computable Numbers</a>、<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halting_problem\">Halting problem</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"丘奇-图灵论题与现代回响\">丘奇—图灵论题与现代回响</h2><p>丘奇—图灵论题的常见表述是：<strong>一个自然数上的函数是有效可计算的，当且仅当它能被图灵机计算。</strong> 由于「有效可计算」是直觉概念而非形式定义，这条论题无法作为定理被证明，但获得近乎普遍的接受 —— 支撑它的是多重形式化的收敛。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式化模型</th>\n<th>提出者</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般递归函数</td>\n<td>Gödel / Herbrand / Kleene</td>\n<td>1933–1936</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>λ 可定义性</td>\n<td>Church / Kleene</td>\n<td>1932–1936</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图灵机</td>\n<td>Turing</td>\n<td>1936</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Post 组合过程 / 正规系统</td>\n<td>Emil Post</td>\n<td>1936 / 1943 / 1946</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Markov 算法</td>\n<td>Andrey Markov</td>\n<td>1954（英译 1960）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>克莱尼起了枢纽作用：1943 年提出「论题 I」，1952 年在《元数学导论》中分别命名「丘奇论题」与「图灵论题」，并首次使用合并称谓「丘奇—图灵论题」。寄存器机、指针机、组合逻辑等后续模型相继被证明与图灵机等价，这种收敛本身就是论题最强的经验证据。</p>\n<p>论题的现代延伸按「加了多少物理约束」分层：<strong>物理版</strong>主张所有物理上可计算的函数都图灵可计算；<strong>强版</strong>（Church–Turing–Deutsch）主张宇宙本身等价于图灵可计算系统；<strong>复杂度版</strong>（可行性论题）说任何现实物理计算模型都能被概率图灵机以多项式开销模拟。只有复杂度版<strong>才</strong>可能被量子计算挑战 —— 若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>⊋</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{BQP} \\supsetneq \\mathrm{BPP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">BQP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⊋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">BPP</span></span></span></span></span></span> 它受影响，但原版论题安然无恙，因为量子图灵机仍可被普通图灵机模拟。</p>\n<p>论题并非没有异议。Post 在 1936 年就拒绝把有效可计算性当作纯定义，认为它需要持续检验；Copeland 视其为经验问题；Lucas 与 Penrose 则主张人类认知可能含非算法成分。争论至今未定，但不影响论题作为「算法可计算」标准刻画的主流地位（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Church%E2%80%93Turing_thesis\">Church–Turing thesis</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>一条时间线</strong>：1928 判定问题提出 → 1930 柯尼斯堡演讲 / 哥德尔宣布结果 → 1931 不完备性定理发表 → 1936 丘奇与图灵各自给出否定解 → 1952 克莱尼命名「丘奇—图灵论题」。</li>\n<li><strong>判定问题的否定解是三件套</strong>：哥德尔配数（把语法算术化）+ 对角化（构造自指）+ 归约（判定问题归到停机问题）。</li>\n<li><strong>三个 1936 年的形式化等价</strong>，把一个直觉概念变成数学对象，这是现代可计算性理论的地基。</li>\n<li><strong>停机问题不可判定</strong>，其证明与康托尔对角线法同源，并被赖斯定理推广到一切非平凡语义性质。</li>\n<li><strong>工程含义</strong>：静态分析的精度上限、类型检查的可判定性、SMT 求解器为何有时返回「unknown」，都可追溯到这批 1930 年代的结果 —— 它们不是数学史花边，而是今天写代码时真实存在的边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章另两节构成前后文：<a href=\"number-systems-and-calculating-tools\">数制与计算工具</a>讲可计算性被形式化前的算术工具史，<a href=\"mechanical-computing-and-babbage\">机械计算与巴贝奇</a>讲这些理论如何落到齿轮与差分机上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基","id":"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"希尔伯特纲领与判定问题","id":"希尔伯特纲领与判定问题"},{"level":2,"text":"哥德尔不完备性定理","id":"哥德尔不完备性定理"},{"level":2,"text":"丘奇的 λ 演算与丘奇定理","id":"丘奇的-演算与丘奇定理"},{"level":2,"text":"图灵机与通用图灵机","id":"图灵机与通用图灵机"},{"level":2,"text":"丘奇—图灵论题与现代回响","id":"丘奇-图灵论题与现代回响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字表示与早期计算工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/number-systems-and-calculating-tools"},"next":{"title":"机械计算机与分析机的历史实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/mechanical-computing-and-babbage"}}